'>{}</span>", "ja486:18.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja486:19.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja486:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja486:0.2": "Pakiṇṇakanipāta ", "ja486:0.3": "Sālikedāravagga ", "ja486:0.4": "3. Mahāukkusajātaka ", "ja486:1.1": "“Ukkā cilācā bandhanti dīpe, ", "ja486:1.2": "Pajā mamaṁ khādituṁ patthayanti; ", "ja486:1.3": "Mittaṁ sahāyañca vadehi senaka, ", "ja486:1.4": "Ācikkha ñātibyasanaṁ dijānaṁ”. ", "ja486:2.1": "“Dijo dijānaṁ pavarosi pakkhima, ", "ja486:2.2": "Ukkusarāja saraṇaṁ taṁ upema; ", "ja486:2.3": "Pajā mamaṁ khādituṁ patthayanti, ", "ja486:2.4": "Luddā cilācā bhava me sukhāya”. ", "ja486:3.1": "“Mittaṁ sahāyañca karonti paṇḍitā, ", "ja486:3.2": "Kāle akāle sukhamesamānā; ", "ja486:3.3": "Karomi te senaka etamatthaṁ, ", "ja486:3.4": "Ariyo hi ariyassa karoti kiccaṁ”. ", "ja486:4.1": "“Yaṁ hoti kiccaṁ anukampakena, ", "ja486:4.2": "Ariyassa ariyena kataṁ tayīdaṁ; ", "ja486:4.3": "Attānurakkhī bhava mā adayhi, ", "ja486:4.4": "Lacchāma putte tayi jīvamāne”. ", "ja486:5.1": "“Taveva rakkhāvaraṇaṁ karonto, ", "ja486:5.2": "Sarīrabhedāpi na santasāmi; ", "ja486:5.3": "Karonti heke sakhīnaṁ sakhāro, ", "ja486:5.4": "Pāṇaṁ cajantā satamesa dhammo”. ", "ja486:6.1": "“Sudukkaraṁ kammamakāsi, ", "ja486:6.2": "aṇḍajāyaṁ vihaṅgamo; ", "ja486:6.3": "Atthāya kuraro putte, ", "ja486:6.4": "aḍḍharatte anāgate”. ", "ja486:7.1": "“Cutāpi heke khalitā sakammunā, ", "ja486:7.2": "Mittānukampāya patiṭṭhahanti; ", "ja486:7.3": "Puttā mamaṭṭā gatimāgatosmi, ", "ja486:7.4": "Atthaṁ caretho mama vāricara”. ", "ja486:8.1": "“Dhanena dhaññena ca attanā ca, ", "ja486:8.2": "Mittaṁ sahāyañca karonti paṇḍitā; ", "ja486:8.3": "Karomi te senaka etamatthaṁ, ", "ja486:8.4": "Ariyo hi ariyassa karoti kiccaṁ”. ", "ja486:9.1": "“Appossukko tāta tuvaṁ nisīda, ", "ja486:9.2": "Putto pitu carati atthacariyaṁ; ", "ja486:9.3": "Ahaṁ carissāmi tavetamatthaṁ, ", "ja486:9.4": "Senassa putte paritāyamāno”. ", "ja486:10.1": "“Addhā hi tāta satamesa dhammo, ", "ja486:10.2": "Putto pitu yaṁ care atthacariyaṁ; ", "ja486:10.3": "Appeva maṁ disvāna pavaḍḍhakāyaṁ, ", "ja486:10.4": "Senassa puttā na viheṭhayeyyuṁ”. ", "ja486:11.1": "“Pasū manussā migavīraseṭṭha, ", "ja486:11.2": "Bhayaṭṭitā seṭṭhamupabbajanti; ", "ja486:11.3": "Puttā mamaṭṭā gatimāgatosmi, ", "ja486:11.4": "Tvaṁ nosi rājā bhava me sukhāya”. ", "ja486:12.1": "“Karomi te senaka etamatthaṁ, ", "ja486:12.2": "Āyāmi te taṁ disataṁ vadhāya; ", "ja486:12.3": "Kathañhi viññū pahu sampajāno, ", "ja486:12.4": "Na vāyame attajanassa guttiyā”. ", "ja486:13.1": "“Mittañca kayirātha suhadayañca, ", "ja486:13.2": "Ayirañca kayirātha sukhāgamāya; ", "ja486:13.3": "Nivatthakocova sarebhihantvā, ", "ja486:13.4": "Modāma puttehi samaṅgibhūtā. ", "ja486:14.1": "Sakamittassa kammena, ", "ja486:14.2": "sahāyassāpalāyino; ", "ja486:14.3": "Kūjantamupakūjanti, ", "ja486:14.4": "lomasā hadayaṅgamaṁ. ", "ja486:15.1": "Mittaṁ sahāyaṁ adhigamma paṇḍito, ", "ja486:15.2": "So bhuñjatī putta pasuṁ dhanaṁ vā; ", "ja486:15.3": "Ahañca puttā ca patī ca mayhaṁ, ", "ja486:15.4": "Mittānukampāya samaṅgibhūtā. ", "ja486:16.1": "Rājavatā sūravatā ca attho, ", "ja486:16.2": "Sampannasakhissa bhavanti hete; ", "ja486:16.3": "So mittavā yasavā uggatatto, ", "ja486:16.4": "Asmiṁdhaloke modati kāmakāmī. ", "ja486:17.1": "Karaṇīyāni mittāni, ", "ja486:17.2": "daliddenāpi senaka; ", "ja486:17.3": "Passa mittānukampāya, ", "ja486:17.4": "samaggamhā sañātake. ", "ja486:18.1": "Sūrena balavantena, ", "ja486:18.2": "yo mitte kurute dijo; ", "ja486:18.3": "Evaṁ so sukhito hoti, ", "ja486:18.4": "yathāhaṁ tvañca senakāti”. ", "ja486:19.1": "Mahāukkusajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja486:0.1": "", "ja486:0.2": "", "ja486:0.3": "", "ja486:0.4": "", "ja486:1.1": "cilācā → milācā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) | dīpe → dīpe (mr) ", "ja486:1.2": "", "ja486:1.3": "", "ja486:1.4": "", "ja486:2.1": "pakkhima → pakkhi (bj, pts-vp-pli1); pakkhi ca (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja486:2.2": "upem